# Ignore everything
*

# Do not ignore .gitignore and other top-level files
!.gitignore
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!README.md

# Do not ignore the src directory itself
!src/

# Now that src/ is "un-ignored," you can define what to ignore within it.
src/* # Ignore everything inside src/
!src/bin/ # But do not ignore the bin/ sub-directory
!src/SEE.txt # And do not ignore this specific file
!src/constants.rs # And do not ignore this file